        <span class="z-subheading">EFFORTLESS 3-STEP PROCESS</span>
        <h2 class="z-heading-lg">How Saline Nasal Irrigation Works</h2>
        <p class="z-section-desc">A complete rinse takes under 30 seconds with no tilting or mess.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="z-steps-grid">
        <div class="z-step-card">
          <div class="z-step-number">STEP 01</div>
          <h3 class="z-step-title">Prepare</h3>
          <p class="z-step-text">
            Fill the upper tank with purified water (distilled, sterile, or previously boiled and cooled). Place a genuine Zavelyn SaltPod capsule into the crushing chamber and close the lid firmly to create the isotonic saline rinse.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="z-step-card">
          <div class="z-step-number">STEP 02</div>
          <h3 class="z-step-title">Position & Rinse</h3>
          <p class="z-step-text">
            Center the soft silicone nose pillows snugly against your nostrils while standing upright over a sink. Press the power button to initiate gentle suction. Saline flows in one side, rinses the cavity, and empties into the waste tank.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="z-step-card">
          <div class="z-step-number">STEP 03</div>
          <h3 class="z-step-title">Clean & Air-Dry</h3>
          <p class="z-step-text">
            Empty the lower waste tank, rinse the components with clean water, and activate Clean-Assist mode. Rest the device on the included hygienic Air-Dry Mat for fast, upright drying between daily uses.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CRITICAL WATER SAFETY GUIDANCE -->
      <div class="z-water-safety-banner">
